function drawingOptions(){const measure=tool==='dimension',w=tool==='wire',template=tool==='template'&&activeTemplate?.category==='Schema',dispo=current()?.type==='dispo'&&!!symbols[tool];$('drawingOptions').hidden=!measure&&!w&&!template&&!dispo&&!pendingAssembly;$('placementAnchorLabel').hidden=!dispo||twoPointPart();for(const id of ['terminalAssistant','contactManager'])$(id).hidden=current()?.type!=='schema';$('templateScaleLabel').hidden=$('templateFit').hidden=!template;for(const id of ['wireCountLabel','wireSpacingLabel','wireDirection'])$(id).hidden=!w;$('measureAxisLabel').hidden=!measure;for(const [id,type]of [['drawFrame','frame'],['drawCabinet','cabinet'],['drawDuct','duct'],['drawRail','rail']]){$(id).hidden=current()?.type!=='dispo';$(id).classList.toggle('active',placementMetadata?.manualPart?.type===type);}$('drawingHint').textContent=twoPointPart()?(linearStart?'Punkt 2 wählen · Länge folgt der Maus · Esc beenden':'Punkt 1 wählen · Danach Punkt 2 · Esc beenden'):measure?['Ersten Messpunkt wählen','Zweiten Messpunkt wählen','Masslinie platzieren'][measurePoints.length]:dispo?'Klick platzieren · Tab Einfügepunkt wechseln · R drehen · Esc beenden':pendingAssembly?'Vorschau platzieren · Esc abbrechen':template?'Klick platzieren · R drehen · Esc beenden':'Zwischenpunkte klicken · Enter abschliessen · Tab Knick wechseln';}
function linearPointer(event){return linearPartPoint(current(),point(event,false),{grid:$('snap').checked,objectSnap:$('objectSnap').checked&&!event.altKey,tolerance:8/zoom});}
function linearDrawing(point){return linearStart&&point?linearPartBetween(current(),tool,{width:placementDimensions.height,depth:placementMetadata.depth},linearStart,point):null;}
function placeLinearPoint(event){
 event.preventDefault();const p=current(),q=linearPointer(event);
 if(q.x<DRAW.left||q.x>DRAW.right||q.y<DRAW.top||q.y>DRAW.bottom)return;
 hoverPoint=q;
 if(!linearStart){linearStart=q;selected=null;multi=[];render();return;}
 try{
  const result=linearDrawing(q);
  if(!result)return toast('Punkt 2 mindestens 10 mm von Punkt 1 entfernt wählen.');
  if(!result.inside)return toast('Das ganze Bauteil muss innerhalb des Zeichenbereichs liegen.');
  if(p.elements.length+p.wires.length>=5000)return toast('Maximal 5000 Elemente pro Seite.');
  change(()=>{p.elements.push(result.element);selected=result.element.id;linearStart=null;hoverPoint=null;});
 }catch(error){toast(error.message);}
}
function drawLinearPlacement(svg){
 let html='',result=null,error='';
 try{result=linearDrawing(hoverPoint);}catch(e){error=e.message;}
 const color=error||result&&!result.inside?'#c62828':'#2463eb',radius=4/zoom;
 const marker=(p,label)=>`<circle cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="${radius}" fill="white" stroke="${color}" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/><text x="${p.x+8/zoom}" y="${p.y-8/zoom}" font-size="${12/zoom}" fill="${color}">${label}</text>`;
 if(result){
  html+=placementMarkup(result.element,current(),doc).replace('id="placementPreview"','');
  html+=`<path d="M${result.start.x} ${result.start.y}L${result.end.x} ${result.end.y}" stroke="${color}" stroke-dasharray="4 3" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/>`;
  html+=marker(result.end,'2');
 }
 if(linearStart)html+=marker(linearStart,'1');else if(hoverPoint)html+=marker(hoverPoint,'1');
 if(html)svg.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<g id="placementPreview" pointer-events="none">${html}</g>`);
 const length=result?Number(result.length.toFixed(1)).toLocaleString('de-CH'):null;
 $('drawingHint').textContent=error||result&&!result.inside?'Bauteil liegt ausserhalb des Zeichenbereichs.':result?`Punkt 2 wählen · Länge: ${length} mm · ${result.element.rotation?'Senkrecht':'Waagrecht'} · Esc beenden`:linearStart?'Punkt 2 wählen · Mindestens 10 mm Länge · Esc beenden':'Punkt 1 wählen · Danach Punkt 2 · Esc beenden';
 if(error)$('drawingHint').textContent=error;
}
function drawMeasure(){const svg=$('paper').querySelector('svg');svg?.querySelector('#measurePreview')?.remove();if(!svg||!hoverPoint)return;let html=`<circle cx="${hoverPoint.x}" cy="${hoverPoint.y}" r="4" fill="white" stroke="#1688a0"/>`;if(measurePoints.length){const a=measurePoints[0],b=measurePoints[1]||hoverPoint,c=measurePoints.length===2?hoverPoint:{x:hoverPoint.x+20,y:hoverPoint.y+20},e=makeDimension(current(),a,b,c,$('measureAxis').value);if(e)html+=placementMarkup(e,current(),doc);}svg.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<g id="measurePreview" pointer-events="none">${html}</g>`);}
$('measureAxis').onchange=drawPlacement;
